    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to care about \"getting better\" when there's nobody home to receive it. if the core of who i am is gone, and i'm just watching this empty shell drift around... does it even make sense to keep forcing the shell to keep going? it feels like i'm just performing a role for a person who isn't there anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
