      "content": "The feeling that nothing matters when you feel so inner-void can make even a simple outcome feel pointless, but for many, recognizing this void is the first crucial step toward healing rather than losing. You are not a broken machine waiting to be fixed, but a sentient being navigating a deep emotional fog, and the relationships around you are real just because you feel empty right now. Please remember that recovery is not about forcing a shell into action, but finding a safe professional space to slowly rediscover the person who was once there.",
